{"ref": "Bava Kamma 4a:18", "heRef": "בבא קמא ד׳ א:י״ח", "sectionRef": "Bava Kamma 4a", "indexTitle": "Bava Kamma", "heIndexTitle": "בבא קמא", "categories": ["Talmud", "Bavli", "Seder Nezikin"], "next": "Bava Kamma 4b", "sectionNames": ["Daf", "Line"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99", "text": "ולטעמיך הא דתני קרנא ארבעה אבות נזיקין ואדם אחד מהן אדם שמירת גופו עליו הוא אלא כדאמר ליה רבי אבהו לתנא תני אדם שמירת גופו עליו"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org", "text": "18 ​¡Y según tu propia lógica! Mira lo que enseñó Karná: 'Hay cuatro categorías principales de daños, y el hombre es una de ellas'. ¿Acaso no dirías también allí que la custodia del cuerpo del hombre recae sobre él mismo? Más bien, la solución es lo que Rabí Abahu le dijo al recitador de tradiciones: 'Modifica la lectura y enseña: En el caso del hombre, la custodia de su cuerpo recae sobre él mismo' (ajustando la frase general de la Mishná)."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.co.il/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - English", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.com/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Talmud Bavli", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%AA%D7%9C%D7%9E%D7%95%D7%93_%D7%91%D7%91%D7%9C%D7%99"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Sefaria Community Translation", "license": "CC0", "versionSource": "https://www.sefaria.org"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "William Davidson Edition - Aramaic", "license": "CC-BY-NC", "versionSource": "https://korenpub.co.il/collections/the-noe-edition-koren-talmud-bavli-1"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "german", "actualLanguage": "de", "versionTitle": "Talmud Bavli. German trans. by Lazarus Goldschmidt, 1929 [de]", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001042448/NLI"}]}